{% doc %}
  Authorization policy support_desk_read (pos-module-mcp spec 12.2). The engine
  resolves a tool's named policy to this fixed app path, so a module cannot
  ship its own; this delegates to the one the support module defines.

  The engine also passes agent, arguments, tool and delegation_mode. Only
  principal is forwarded, because that is all this policy reads; a policy that
  needs more takes it, and this shim grows the same line.

  Fail-closed: the engine treats a missing partial, an error, or anything other
  than an explicit allow as a denial.
  @param {object} principal - The MCP principal, { id, user_id }
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  function decision = 'modules/support/mcp/policies/support_desk_read', principal: principal
  return decision
%}
